! LiquidCooling_9_6MW_1Cluster_CaseB2_ChillerEIR_IntegratedWSE.idf
! Case B-2: Integrated WSE partial-cooling model using Chiller:Electric:EIR.
! WSE pre-cools chilled water upstream of the EIR chiller.
! Single chiller-level ratings are applied.

